sequenceDiagram
    participant STS as 🧪 STS Validator
    participant Router as 🔀 Intent Router
    participant Corpus as 🧠 Corpus Callosum
    participant SPE as 📚 Strategic Planning<br/>Expert Agent
    participant IE as 🔍 Investigation<br/>Expert Agent
    participant Brain as 💾 4-Tier Brain
    
    %% Handoff Test 1: Planning to Investigation
    rect rgb(123, 104, 238)
        Note over STS,Brain: HANDOFF TEST 1: Planning → Investigation
        STS->>Router: Request: "Plan feature X then investigate bug Y"
        activate Router
        
        Router->>Router: Parse intent:<br/>• Primary: feature_planning<br/>• Secondary: bug_investigation
        Router-->>Corpus: Route to Strategic Planning Expert
        deactivate Router
        
        activate Corpus
        Corpus->>SPE: Activate agent (task: plan feature X)
        deactivate Corpus
        
        activate SPE
        SPE->>SPE: Analyze feature complexity
        SPE->>SPE: Generate implementation plan:<br/>• 5 phases<br/>• 12 tasks<br/>• TDD integration
        
        SPE->>Brain: Store plan in Tier 2<br/>(knowledge graph)
        Brain-->>SPE: ✅ Plan stored
        
        SPE->>SPE: ⏱️ Start handoff timer
        SPE->>Corpus: Handoff required:<br/>task: bug_investigation<br/>context: feature_plan_id
        deactivate SPE
        
        activate Corpus
        Corpus->>Corpus: Validate handoff:<br/>• Context packaged<br/>• Agent available<br/>• No data loss
        
        Corpus->>IE: Activate agent (task: investigate bug Y)
        Corpus->>IE: Transfer context:<br/>• Feature plan context<br/>• Related codebase info<br/>• Previous conversation
        deactivate Corpus
        
        activate IE
        IE->>IE: Receive context ✓
        IE->>IE: ⏱️ Measure handoff latency: 28ms
        
        IE->>Brain: Query related issues from Tier 2
        Brain-->>IE: Historical patterns retrieved
        
        IE->>IE: Investigate bug:<br/>• Root cause: async race condition<br/>• Impact: high<br/>• Fix: add mutex lock
        
        IE->>Brain: Store investigation results
        Brain-->>IE: ✅ Results stored
        
        IE-->>STS: ✅ Handoff 1 complete<br/>Latency: 28ms
        deactivate IE
    end
    
    %% Handoff Test 2: Investigation to Planning
